      <h2 id="about-heading" class="section-heading story-heading">From SEND advocacy to practical classroom ideas.</h2>
      <div class="story-copy">
        <p class="eyebrow eyebrow-on-sage">Our story</p>
        <p class="section-lead text-lead">I’m Daniel, founder of ReguMove and a SEND Tribunal Advocate.</p>
        <p class="text-body">
          My work has made me think closely about the gap between recognising a child’s needs and making everyday learning work for them. ReguMove is my practical response: exploring how movement, tactile activity and feedback can be built into the tools children use.
        </p>
        <p class="text-body">
          I want to hear from the schools, professionals and families who understand these challenges first-hand, so their experiences can help shape what comes next.
        </p>
